 "notes": "Paper constrains gauged B-L (and B) dark photon dark matter using LISA Pathfinder auxiliary channel (SC-TM relative acceleration). Fig 5 plots gauge coupling g_BL vs vector boson mass; world-leading in 4e-19 to 3e-17 eV with peak sensitivity ~5e-18 eV. Data points are approximate reads of the observed 'LISA Pathfinder (relative acceleration)' curve from figs 3/5 (V-shaped minimum at peak); values could easily be off by a factor of a few. g_BL = eps_BL * e (e~0.303). rho_DM=0.4 GeV/cm^3 assumed. This is a data-based estimate/recast rather than a full collaboration analysis, but represents a new exclusion. Distinct LISA/LPF forecast (dashed/dotted) lines were excluded as they are projections. | vector-trace candidate: figure_3.pdf colour (1.0, 0.0, 0.0), 52 pts (selected among 12) | selector: vector_trace over text (quality (1, 1, 1, 1, 3.5, 0, 0.85, 52))",
